 .../sm8150-microsoft-surface-duo-flash.dtsi   | 21 ++++++
 ...8150-microsoft-surface-duo-imx351-bob.dtsi | 11 ---
 .../sm8150-microsoft-surface-duo-ipa.dtsi     | 73 ------------------
 ...sm8150-microsoft-surface-duo-l17a-3v0.dtsi | 12 ---
 ...0-microsoft-surface-duo-venus-axicrst.dtsi | 74 -------------------
 .../dts/qcom/sm8150-microsoft-surface-duo.dts | 12 +--
